  - name: "VR System"
    description: "A virtual-reality simulator built into the skull holding up to four programmed environments. While it runs the ''borg is in a trance, living in the program in any shape it chooses; the Dakir left a large library of forest scenes, romances, adventures and sports. It exists to keep the cyborgs from boredom and depression."
  - name: "Robotic Attributes and Stealth"
    description: "Robotic P.S. 35 and P.P. 26 (stored as attribute_dice). Running speed 70 mph (112 km/h). The stealth systems add +5% to Prowl (already in the skill) and impose no prowl penalty; enemy sensors are -15% to detect the ''borg, and Detect Ambush, Tracking and similar skills are -15% to sense it. Robot P.S. means mega-damage in hand to hand: restrained punch 1D4 M.D., full punch 2D4 M.D., head butt 1D4 M.D., kick 2D6 M.D., leap or power kick 4D6 M.D. (two attacks), power punch 3D6 M.D. (two attacks), all plus the P.S. damage bonus as M.D."
  - name: "Sensory Systems"
