  - name: "Implanted Weapons"
    description: "A built-in particle beam blaster, 6D6+6 M.D., range 500 feet (152 m), powered by the internal plant. Three retractable slashing vibro-sabers in one wrist (the player picks which), 3D6+6 M.D. in hand to hand combat."
  - name: "Targeting Systems"
    description: "+1 to strike with any ranged weapon, on top of the combat bonuses on the sheet."
restrictions:
